#: view.cpp:139
msgid "The KDE team welcomes you to user-friendly UNIX computing"
msgstr "KDE tim vam želi dobrodošlicu u user-friendly UNIX okruženje"

#: view.cpp:140
msgid ""
"KDE is a powerful graphical desktop environment for UNIX workstations. A\n"
"KDE desktop combines ease of use, contemporary functionality and "
"outstanding\n"
"graphical design with the technological superiority of the UNIX operating\n"
"system."
msgstr ""
"KDE je moćna grafička okolina za Unix radne stanice. KDE radna površina\n"
"objedinjuje jednostavnost upotrebe, savremene funkcionalnosti i\n"
"izvanredan grafički dizajn sa tehnološkom superiornošću Unix "
"operativnog\n"
"sistema."

#: view.cpp:144
msgid "What is the K Desktop Environment?"
msgstr "Šta je KDE?"

